# Dry-run publish gate phase 5: Clean-Room Verification — Kestrel Toolkit
# release-candidate case study. One domain FRAGMENT of the shared
# kestrel-dry-run-publish-cycle domain: this phase's 3 actions chain
# manufacture-complete -> cleanroom-step1-done -> cleanroom-step2-done -> cleanroom-complete,
# so the merged cycle plan can only reach this phase after Phase 4
# (Package Manufacture) completes. 8-constraint split: every
# precondition/effect/goal here is a 1-conjunct (and ...) — far inside
# PDDL8_MAX_CONJUNCTS=8 — and each action takes 1 parameter
# (PDDL8_MAX_PARAMS=8); the dry-run harness asserts these bounds
# mechanically for every fragment (reusing
# crate::bench::togaf::verify_eight_constraint_split verbatim).
#
# DRY-RUN-OVERCLAIM FENCE: no action effect below is named "published",
# "crates-io-uploaded", or "release-complete" — unpacking the manufactured
# package into a fresh directory and building/testing it there, isolated
# from the dev workspace, is a LOCAL, REVERSIBLE verification, never an
# external upload. See packs/dry-run-publish-pack/ontology.ttl for the full
# fence disclosure.
#
# Public-ontology doctrine: the artifact node is a blank node; the phase is
# identified by its public SKOS notation. The only private predicate is
# the cng pipeline's ABI carrier ceng:pddlDomain (urn:chatman:engine#),
# disclosed in packs/dry-run-publish-pack/ontology.ttl.
@prefix ceng:    <urn:chatman:engine#> .
@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

_:artifact
    skos:notation "DRY-RUN-CLEANROOM" ;
    dcterms:description "Clean-Room Verification domain fragment of the kestrel-dry-run-publish-cycle STRIPS domain."@en ;
    ceng:pddlDomain """
(define (domain kestrel-dry-run-publish-cycle)
  (:requirements :strips)
  (:predicates
    (manufacture-complete ?x)
    (cleanroom-step1-done ?x)
    (cleanroom-step2-done ?x)
    (cleanroom-complete ?x))
  (:action unpack-in-fresh-directory
    :parameters (?x)
    :precondition (and (manufacture-complete ?x))
    :effect (and (cleanroom-step1-done ?x)))
  (:action build-in-cleanroom
    :parameters (?x)
    :precondition (and (cleanroom-step1-done ?x))
    :effect (and (cleanroom-step2-done ?x)))
  (:action test-in-cleanroom
    :parameters (?x)
    :precondition (and (cleanroom-step2-done ?x))
    :effect (and (cleanroom-complete ?x))))
""" .
